			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Update ignore patterns in .prettierignore, settings.json, and biome.json for autogenerated and build files\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "dfbc7819e6021d6d9ef677e3b71590d7b75e7929"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-20T06:38:58Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				129,
				2
			],
			"Message": "style(Land): Collapse biome.json ignore array and advance Element submodule with config indentation normalization\n\nCollapse the Biome `files.ignore` array from multi-line to single-line format in the Land-root biome.json, consistent with the project's preference for compact array formatting in config files.\n\nAdvance the Element submodule to cf4b0c66, which applies a coordinated indentation and import-ordering normalization pass across five submodules (Cocoon, Mountain, Output, Wind, Worker). All ESBuild configuration modules are converted from tab to 2-space indentation, re-exports are placed before local imports, duplicate aliases deduplicated, and arrow-function bodies collapsed or expanded to named multi-line blocks. Output artifacts and Tauri configuration identifiers are similarly normalised. Mountain additionally reverts a transitional verbose identifier scheme back to the stable `\"fiddee.editor.binary\"` product identifier, and leftover backup files from the transitional phase are deleted.\n\nNo functional changes — build outputs and runtime behaviour are identical across all five submodules and the Biome lint exclusion set is unchanged.",
			"SHA": "7ab6c9392fb253642cd85b573c323472d2a3737d"
		},
